      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Moovingo are delighted to present this superb 2-bed apartment to the market. The property offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation with a spacious open-plan living and dining area creating a comfortable and contemporary living space. The kitchen is neatly integrated with the main living area, while large windows provide excellent natural light and access to a private balcony.\r\n\r\nThere are two generously sized bedrooms, including a master bedroom with en-suite, along with a separate main bathroom. Fitted wardrobes provide good storage, while the overall layout has been thoughtfully designed to maximise both space and practicality. A separate utility room also provides great additional practical benefit to the apartment.\r\n\r\nThe property also benefits from a private south-west-facing balcony, a designated secure underground parking space, a private underground storage unit, and secure fob-controlled access to the development. The block itself is set amongst beautifully maintained landscaped gardens and mature communal grounds.\r\n\r\nArea Info:\r\n\r\nTrimbleston is a well-established residential development situated just off Goatstown Road in Dublin 14. Originally developed by Sorohan Builders, the scheme comprises a mix of houses, duplexes and apartments set amongst mature landscaped grounds, lawns and attractive walkways. Its location offers a quiet residential setting while remaining within easy reach of Dundrum, Stillorgan and the city centre.\r\n\r\nThe development is particularly well positioned for local amenities, with UCD Belfield within walking and cycling distance and Dundrum Town Centre approximately 1.5km away. There is an excellent selection of schools in the surrounding area, including Our Lady’s Grove, Mount Anville, St. Kilian’s, Taney National School and St. Benildus. Residents also have convenient access to local shops, cafés and restaurants, while the wider amenities of Dundrum and Stillorgan are close by.\r\n\r\nTransport links are well catered for, with bus services operating along Goatstown Road and the Green Line Luas accessible at Windy Arbour and Dundrum. The area also provides convenient access to the N11 and M50, connecting to the city centre and the wider Dublin road network. The combination of established surroundings, excellent amenities and proximity to UCD and major transport links makes Trimbleston a particularly convenient Dublin 14 location.\r\n\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Any intending purchaser(s) shall accept that no statement, description or measurement contained in advertisement or any other document or published by the vendor or by Moovingo, in respect of the premises shall constitute a representation inducing the purchaser(s) to enter into any contract for sale, or any warranty forming part of any such contract for sale. Any such statement, description or measurement, whether in writing or in oral form, given by the vendor, or by Moovingo, are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact. Any intending purchaser(s) shall satisfy themselves by inspection, survey or otherwise as to the correctness of same. No omission, misstatement, misdescription, incorrect measurement or error of any description, whether given orally or in any written form by the vendor or by Moovingo, shall give rise to any claim for compensation against the vendor or against Moovingo. Any intending purchaser(s) are deemed to fully satisfy themselves in relation to all such matters."
      },
